# AGENTS.md

## Stack
Next.js 14 (App Router) + tRPC + Drizzle ORM. DB access is server-only — never
import `src/server/db` from a client component.

## Commands
- Install: `pnpm install`        # never npm/yarn — only pnpm matches the lockfile
- Dev: `pnpm dev`
- Build: `pnpm build`
- Test (all): `pnpm test`
- Test (one): `pnpm vitest run src/path/to/file.test.ts`
- Check (lint+format+types): `pnpm check`   # run before finishing any task

## Boundaries
- Never edit `src/server/db/schema.gen.ts` — generated from migrations.
- Never commit `.env*`.
- Ask first before adding a new dependency.

## Conventions (non-default)
- Server data fetching goes through tRPC routers in `src/server/routers/`; do not
  write API route handlers by hand.
- Money is stored and passed as integer cents, never floats.

## Specialized rules — read the file when its trigger applies
- Changing the DB schema or writing a migration → read `docs/database.md`
- Adding/modifying a tRPC procedure → read `docs/trpc.md`
- Writing tests → read `docs/testing.md`
